  "independent_source_contract": "C2 V on Euclidean space with kappa>=1 and kappa^-1 I<=Hess V<=I; every eta>0; proximal p=argmin(V+distance²/(2eta)); genuine posterior R_eta,y with normalized density exp(-V(x)-distance²/(2eta)); affine standardized r from(X-p)/sqrteta; rho(u)=V(p+sqrteta*u)-V(p)-sqrteta<gradV(p),u>; r=q gamma with q=e^-rho/Z. Source first4.6 invokes GaussianLSI+T2 to bound W2 by sqrt integral true normgrad rho². Needed KL-half-Fisher is an authored integration leaf, not separately printed theorem. No numericalprox cap or eta<=1 imposed on this analytic slice. Canonical selected RN/llr is only AE; smooth rho gradient is literal smooth representative, never canonicalRN derivative.",
  "domain_obligations": "Probability/positive actual partitions/true posterior and standardized law/density identity/L2 sqrt density/gradient and entropy domains, finite ENNRealKL/llrL1/entropy identities must be produced by actual same proximal witness integration, not public output certificates. T2/W2 and stronger weak-Sobolev representative/full source4.6 are separate.",
